{%- layout none -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Corvo addition: a guide to the site for AI assistants, in plain text (the "llms.txt" convention, llmstxt.org).

  It is written from the shop's own data, so it never falls out of date: the rugs, their materials, sizes and prices
  are read as the page is served. To publish it, create a page that uses this template and redirect /llms.txt to it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign rugs = collections.all.products
  assign sample = all_products['rug-sample']
-%}
# Corvo

> {{ 'general.corvo.description' | t }}

## Key facts

- Who: Corvo, a maker of bespoke and made-to-order rugs in {{ 'general.corvo.locality' | t }}, Portugal. Part of the {{ 'general.corvo.parent' | t }} Group.
- What: {{ collections.all.products_count }} rug designs in six collections. Every rug is made to order by hand in Portugal.
- Sizes: each design comes in five standard sizes, and is made to measure in any size up to 12 × 7 m.
- Colours: every colour of a design can be changed, to a colour of the Open Palette or to a custom colour.
- Prices: shown on each rug page in euros, VAT included. A made-to-measure price is calculated on the rug page from the price per m² of the design.
{%- if sample.available %}
- Samples: a {{ sample.selected_or_first_available_variant.title | replace: 'x', ' × ' }} sample of any rug costs {{ sample.selected_or_first_available_variant.price | money }}.
{%- endif %}
- Lead time: {{ 'general.corvo.lead_time' | t }}.
- Delivery: worldwide. {{ 'general.corvo.delivery' | t }}.
- Orders: an order can be changed or cancelled up to 48 business hours after Corvo confirms it. A defect must be reported in writing within 10 business days of receiving the rug, with photographs.
- Website: {{ shop.url }}

## Main pages

- [All rugs]({{ shop.url }}/collections/all): every design, with filters by collection, craft level, material, pile and colour.
{% for link in linklists['collection-links'].links -%}
{%- if link.type == 'collection_link' -%}
- [{{ link.title }} collection]({{ shop.url }}{{ link.url }}){% if link.object.description != blank %}: {{ link.object.description | strip_html | strip_newlines | truncate: 160 }}{% endif %}
{% endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
- [Bespoke]({{ shop.url }}/pages/bespoke): how a rug is designed and made for one project.
- [Samples]({{ shop.url }}/pages/samples): order a sample of any rug.
- [Care and questions]({{ shop.url }}/pages/care-faq): care, delivery and the questions asked most often.
- [Story]({{ shop.url }}/pages/about-us): where Corvo comes from.
- [Contact]({{ shop.url }}/pages/contact): start a project or book a meeting.

## Rugs

{% for rug in rugs -%}
{%- liquid
  assign craft = rug.metafields.rug.craft_level.value
  if craft == blank
    continue
  endif
  assign materials = rug.metafields.rug.materials.value | map: 'name' | map: 'value' | join: ', '
  assign own_factor = rug.metafields.rug.supplement.value | default: 0 | plus: 100 | divided_by: 100.0
  assign per_m2 = craft.retail_per_m2.value | times: own_factor | times: 1.23 | times: 100 | round
-%}
- [{{ rug.title }}]({{ shop.url }}{{ rug.url }}): {{ craft.label.value }}{% if materials != blank %}; {{ materials }}{% endif %}{% if rug.metafields.rug.pile_height.value != blank %}; pile {{ rug.metafields.rug.pile_height.value }}{% endif %}; standard sizes from {{ rug.price_min | money }} to {{ rug.price_max | money }}; made to measure at {{ per_m2 | money }} per m², VAT included.
{% endfor %}
